[
  {
    "text": "So uh so good evening uh yeah welcome uh",
    "start": 0.64,
    "duration": 10.56
  },
  {
    "text": "welcome to you all",
    "start": 8.96,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "uh good to be uh yeah good to be",
    "start": 11.2,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "practicing together.",
    "start": 14.96,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "So, um yeah, please find your your",
    "start": 18.16,
    "duration": 10.279
  },
  {
    "text": "posture. We'll uh we'll sit together.",
    "start": 22.16,
    "duration": 6.279
  },
  {
    "text": "How far away is peace?",
    "start": 68.88,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And how do our ideas",
    "start": 88.799,
    "duration": 7.481
  },
  {
    "text": "of distance",
    "start": 92.96,
    "duration": 3.32
  },
  {
    "text": "contribute to distance?",
    "start": 97.2,
    "duration": 3.959
  },
  {
    "text": "Just feel all the practice you've ever",
    "start": 122.719,
    "duration": 5.961
  },
  {
    "text": "done,",
    "start": 125.68,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "all the effort and",
    "start": 135.92,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "renunciation.",
    "start": 140.16,
    "duration": 6.6
  },
  {
    "text": "All the moments of willingness,",
    "start": 142.72,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "all of the suffering and all of the",
    "start": 151.28,
    "duration": 5.4
  },
  {
    "text": "love.",
    "start": 153.68,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Just all right Here.",
    "start": 166.08,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "Maybe you have a sense of the",
    "start": 243.519,
    "duration": 8.241
  },
  {
    "text": "the lineage, the kind of",
    "start": 247.28,
    "duration": 9.159
  },
  {
    "text": "shelter afforded by",
    "start": 251.76,
    "duration": 4.679
  },
  {
    "text": "thousands of years.",
    "start": 259.04,
    "duration": 7.0
  },
  {
    "text": "The practice of wisdom,",
    "start": 262.079,
    "duration": 3.961
  },
  {
    "text": "compassion,",
    "start": 266.16,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "sense of finding ourselves in",
    "start": 273.199,
    "duration": 7.881
  },
  {
    "text": "that stream.",
    "start": 277.199,
    "duration": 3.881
  },
  {
    "text": "And just taking our cues from that",
    "start": 295.919,
    "duration": 4.761
  },
  {
    "text": "as we breathe.",
    "start": 302.0,
    "duration": 4.68
  },
  {
    "text": "Feel our bodies.",
    "start": 312.8,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "Discerning what kind of orientation to",
    "start": 420.24,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "the object is",
    "start": 423.36,
    "duration": 6.44
  },
  {
    "text": "optimal.",
    "start": 426.8,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "objective",
    "start": 431.199,
    "duration": 6.44
  },
  {
    "text": "say or breathing.",
    "start": 434.08,
    "duration": 3.559
  },
  {
    "text": "How penetrating",
    "start": 442.88,
    "duration": 10.039
  },
  {
    "text": "should your attention be or how light",
    "start": 447.199,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "How much fidelity",
    "start": 466.0,
    "duration": 7.4
  },
  {
    "text": "to just that",
    "start": 469.84,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "it's conducive to mindfulness.",
    "start": 474.8,
    "duration": 5.16
  },
  {
    "text": "How often or how continuously",
    "start": 494.24,
    "duration": 8.679
  },
  {
    "text": "are you served by",
    "start": 498.72,
    "duration": 4.199
  },
  {
    "text": "relaxing",
    "start": 505.52,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Clinging in the attempt to control",
    "start": 515.919,
    "duration": 4.841
  },
  {
    "text": "is uh",
    "start": 523.36,
    "duration": 6.599
  },
  {
    "text": "correlated with tension.",
    "start": 526.16,
    "duration": 3.799
  },
  {
    "text": "As we consciously relax,",
    "start": 543.76,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "can be more confident.",
    "start": 552.399,
    "duration": 4.681
  },
  {
    "text": "We're not trying to control so much.",
    "start": 557.839,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "We give the mind boundaries",
    "start": 592.959,
    "duration": 4.601
  },
  {
    "text": "but that doesn't uh",
    "start": 599.2,
    "duration": 6.84
  },
  {
    "text": "feel like control.",
    "start": 602.32,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Feels",
    "start": 727.2,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "like uh",
    "start": 742.16,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "we have to do a good job.",
    "start": 744.88,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "But mindfulness is actually a",
    "start": 759.2,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "recognition of all",
    "start": 761.519,
    "duration": 6.921
  },
  {
    "text": "that we do not govern.",
    "start": 764.48,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "Kind of harmonizing of the heart",
    "start": 770.399,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "with ungovernability.",
    "start": 777.839,
    "duration": 3.321
  },
  {
    "text": "This is not another forum",
    "start": 800.399,
    "duration": 9.24
  },
  {
    "text": "for your governance.",
    "start": 804.88,
    "duration": 4.759
  },
  {
    "text": "There's already",
    "start": 834.56,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "more than enough.",
    "start": 840.88,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "We don't need to go foraging for",
    "start": 845.839,
    "duration": 5.401
  },
  {
    "text": "goodness.",
    "start": 848.24,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Meditation is the trust that",
    "start": 1393.679,
    "duration": 6.201
  },
  {
    "text": "the moment will not harm our heart.",
    "start": 1402.0,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "But we need not keep tabs",
    "start": 1420.08,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "on everything right and everything wrong",
    "start": 1424.32,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "in this moment.",
    "start": 1426.64,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "Keep tabs on our",
    "start": 1429.36,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "preferences.",
    "start": 1432.48,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Keep reiterating",
    "start": 1443.039,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "story",
    "start": 1448.0,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "self.",
    "start": 1449.52,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Just take our cues from the silence.",
    "start": 1467.44,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 1726.44,
    "duration": 3.099
  },
  {
    "text": "[Music]",
    "start": 1735.69,
    "duration": 3.069
  },
  {
    "text": "Okay, folks. Good to uh to practice with",
    "start": 1796.88,
    "duration": 6.44
  },
  {
    "text": "you.",
    "start": 1800.32,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "So, um I won't be here next week. We'll",
    "start": 1803.44,
    "duration": 8.479
  },
  {
    "text": "be uh back on the 15th.",
    "start": 1806.799,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Um,",
    "start": 1811.919,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "so I uh I uh read interview yesterday",
    "start": 1819.76,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "with um",
    "start": 1823.919,
    "duration": 6.561
  },
  {
    "text": "filmmaker uh Jim Jarmish.",
    "start": 1826.72,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "did um Mystery Train",
    "start": 1830.48,
    "duration": 8.16
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh Ghost Dog, other other films",
    "start": 1833.84,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh and then just made a a movie. I",
    "start": 1838.64,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "haven't seen a kind of slow burn film",
    "start": 1841.76,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "about a family, father, mother, sister,",
    "start": 1844.64,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "brother.",
    "start": 1849.12,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh the interview says um uh you know",
    "start": 1851.6,
    "duration": 9.52
  },
  {
    "text": "Jenny Beth from Savages.",
    "start": 1858.24,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "I don't know who that is.",
    "start": 1861.12,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "Um but you know Jenny Beth from Savages.",
    "start": 1863.6,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "I says to the interviewer, I like her",
    "start": 1866.96,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "attitude, her music. She said in an",
    "start": 1869.84,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "interview,",
    "start": 1872.799,
    "duration": 4.48
  },
  {
    "text": "\"Art doesn't have to talk about politics",
    "start": 1874.32,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "to be political.",
    "start": 1877.279,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Change the world. Artists are here to",
    "start": 1879.44,
    "duration": 7.599
  },
  {
    "text": "open us, to make us feel more in touch",
    "start": 1883.279,
    "duration": 7.201
  },
  {
    "text": "with others, connected and empa,",
    "start": 1887.039,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "empathetic.",
    "start": 1890.48,
    "duration": 5.24
  },
  {
    "text": "It's what art does.",
    "start": 1892.0,
    "duration": 3.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And Charmer says, I was like, gee, I",
    "start": 1895.84,
    "duration": 6.319
  },
  {
    "text": "wish I said that.",
    "start": 1899.519,
    "duration": 4.801
  },
  {
    "text": "To not directly talk about politics does",
    "start": 1902.159,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "not mean something's not isn't",
    "start": 1904.32,
    "duration": 3.92
  },
  {
    "text": "political.",
    "start": 1906.159,
    "duration": 4.081
  },
  {
    "text": "But for me, the political thing is to",
    "start": 1908.24,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "protect empathy in a way.",
    "start": 1910.24,
    "duration": 8.159
  },
  {
    "text": "The last time I saw Joe Strummer also do",
    "start": 1914.159,
    "duration": 6.481
  },
  {
    "text": "not know, but from the clash, it's",
    "start": 1918.399,
    "duration": 4.721
  },
  {
    "text": "probably really embarrassing to admit",
    "start": 1920.64,
    "duration": 4.399
  },
  {
    "text": "that on YouTube.",
    "start": 1923.12,
    "duration": 6.559
  },
  {
    "text": "Um, last time I saw Joe Joe Strummer um",
    "start": 1925.039,
    "duration": 7.041
  },
  {
    "text": "died in 2002.",
    "start": 1929.679,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "Um, he was in New York.",
    "start": 1932.08,
    "duration": 5.199
  },
  {
    "text": "He walked me back to my home from a",
    "start": 1934.64,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "restaurant because I had the flu or",
    "start": 1937.279,
    "duration": 3.921
  },
  {
    "text": "something.",
    "start": 1939.6,
    "duration": 4.16
  },
  {
    "text": "He stopped at my door and looked me in",
    "start": 1941.2,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the eye. And I'll never ever forget",
    "start": 1943.76,
    "duration": 7.44
  },
  {
    "text": "this. He said, \"Jim,",
    "start": 1947.2,
    "duration": 8.479
  },
  {
    "text": "our job is to protect empathy at all",
    "start": 1951.2,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "costs",
    "start": 1955.679,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "and to live groovy lives.\"",
    "start": 1957.6,
    "duration": 7.439
  },
  {
    "text": "And then he left into the rain. He died",
    "start": 1961.36,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "five weeks later.",
    "start": 1965.039,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "I've been trying to live by that.",
    "start": 1967.44,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "Protect empathy at all costs",
    "start": 1970.799,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "and to live groovy lives.",
    "start": 1974.24,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "Trying to do both.",
    "start": 1977.919,
    "duration": 5.841
  },
  {
    "text": "Trying to enjoy the strangeness of my",
    "start": 1980.64,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "life.",
    "start": 1983.76,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "But I am trying in my work to protect",
    "start": 1985.76,
    "duration": 7.159
  },
  {
    "text": "empathy.",
    "start": 1989.919,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "So usually we don't think about dharma",
    "start": 1996.24,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "as art. Uh",
    "start": 1998.96,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "and in some respects it seems like",
    "start": 2001.76,
    "duration": 7.039
  },
  {
    "text": "superficial. It ignores aesthetics as as",
    "start": 2005.12,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "uh trivial. It's all tarnished in some",
    "start": 2008.799,
    "duration": 8.081
  },
  {
    "text": "way. become disenchanted with samsara.",
    "start": 2012.32,
    "duration": 10.32
  },
  {
    "text": "Um yet I would add that um the dharma is",
    "start": 2016.88,
    "duration": 8.56
  },
  {
    "text": "an artistic path.",
    "start": 2022.64,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "The sense that there is an aesthetic to",
    "start": 2025.44,
    "duration": 5.44
  },
  {
    "text": "goodness",
    "start": 2028.48,
    "duration": 8.16
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of elegance, cleanliness.",
    "start": 2030.88,
    "duration": 9.639
  },
  {
    "text": "We try to honor that.",
    "start": 2036.64,
    "duration": 3.879
  },
  {
    "text": "And the dharma's many things. One of",
    "start": 2041.519,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "them is the process of turning one's",
    "start": 2044.88,
    "duration": 9.12
  },
  {
    "text": "one's heart into something like art.",
    "start": 2049.119,
    "duration": 6.881
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 2054.0,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "you have to do a lot of hard work",
    "start": 2056.0,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "to turn your heart into something",
    "start": 2060.24,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "beautiful.",
    "start": 2062.159,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "You also",
    "start": 2065.04,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "don't have to do anything",
    "start": 2067.04,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "whatsoever.",
    "start": 2070.32,
    "duration": 3.44
  },
  {
    "text": "Turn your heart into something",
    "start": 2072.24,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "beautiful.",
    "start": 2073.76,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And many times I I have these moments",
    "start": 2076.879,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of perceive the heart of sometimes",
    "start": 2080.96,
    "duration": 8.879
  },
  {
    "text": "my teachers, sometimes students.",
    "start": 2085.119,
    "duration": 8.881
  },
  {
    "text": "and and the beauty in that moment sort",
    "start": 2089.839,
    "duration": 6.881
  },
  {
    "text": "of elilludes words",
    "start": 2094.0,
    "duration": 5.359
  },
  {
    "text": "and there's a kind of",
    "start": 2096.72,
    "duration": 7.04
  },
  {
    "text": "awe that I feel as I as I kind of compl",
    "start": 2099.359,
    "duration": 9.681
  },
  {
    "text": "contemplate um like all the mind moments",
    "start": 2103.76,
    "duration": 8.72
  },
  {
    "text": "that shaped and informed their heart in",
    "start": 2109.04,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "that moment.",
    "start": 2112.48,
    "duration": 6.04
  },
  {
    "text": "all the mind moments",
    "start": 2114.72,
    "duration": 3.8
  },
  {
    "text": "and sa is",
    "start": 2119.119,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "is many things. It's",
    "start": 2122.56,
    "duration": 10.039
  },
  {
    "text": "a grief ritual and it's a pep rally.",
    "start": 2126.24,
    "duration": 6.359
  },
  {
    "text": "Most crucially for me, it's a kind of",
    "start": 2133.119,
    "duration": 8.921
  },
  {
    "text": "collective sensitization to goodness",
    "start": 2136.48,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "and uh and dwelling in it.",
    "start": 2142.56,
    "duration": 5.559
  },
  {
    "text": "And in in their their role, you know,",
    "start": 2148.16,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "dharma teachers um receive a lot of uh",
    "start": 2150.32,
    "duration": 10.96
  },
  {
    "text": "gratitude and and love and um in no way",
    "start": 2154.96,
    "duration": 8.639
  },
  {
    "text": "dismissive of that.",
    "start": 2161.28,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "But I I've never wanted to be loved, but",
    "start": 2163.599,
    "duration": 9.52
  },
  {
    "text": "I've desperately wanted to abide",
    "start": 2168.24,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "what",
    "start": 2173.119,
    "duration": 4.561
  },
  {
    "text": "we both love.",
    "start": 2174.64,
    "duration": 5.439
  },
  {
    "text": "and abiding",
    "start": 2177.68,
    "duration": 5.679
  },
  {
    "text": "in what we love.",
    "start": 2180.079,
    "duration": 5.681
  },
  {
    "text": "That's sa",
    "start": 2183.359,
    "duration": 6.041
  },
  {
    "text": "spiritual friendship.",
    "start": 2185.76,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "Sana",
    "start": 2189.68,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "is the um collective practice of",
    "start": 2191.44,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "empathy.",
    "start": 2194.56,
    "duration": 4.96
  },
  {
    "text": "And",
    "start": 2197.2,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "first in our in our practice we we kind",
    "start": 2199.52,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "of direct empathy to ourselves like",
    "start": 2202.96,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "dharma. It's a training in selfdirected",
    "start": 2205.68,
    "duration": 9.439
  },
  {
    "text": "empathy. That's the nature of awareness.",
    "start": 2209.68,
    "duration": 11.76
  },
  {
    "text": "What is it actually like to be human?",
    "start": 2215.119,
    "duration": 10.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Conscious experience is always",
    "start": 2221.44,
    "duration": 7.679
  },
  {
    "text": "like something.",
    "start": 2225.839,
    "duration": 6.841
  },
  {
    "text": "What is it like?",
    "start": 2229.119,
    "duration": 3.561
  },
  {
    "text": "And the poignency um",
    "start": 2233.76,
    "duration": 8.319
  },
  {
    "text": "of being a sentient creature in a world",
    "start": 2238.0,
    "duration": 8.56
  },
  {
    "text": "that trembles in all directions. That",
    "start": 2242.079,
    "duration": 8.841
  },
  {
    "text": "poignency dawn unmistakably.",
    "start": 2246.56,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "And uh there's care for our self,",
    "start": 2250.96,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "empathy.",
    "start": 2254.56,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "And then that circle expands. The",
    "start": 2256.32,
    "duration": 5.36
  },
  {
    "text": "empathy expands and expands again across",
    "start": 2258.88,
    "duration": 6.92
  },
  {
    "text": "space, across time.",
    "start": 2261.68,
    "duration": 4.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Our um our species",
    "start": 2267.44,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "uh as I've read a very tough time moving",
    "start": 2271.28,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "from the geocentric model to the",
    "start": 2274.8,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "heliocentric model. It's kind of brutal",
    "start": 2277.52,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "for our grandiosity to recognize that",
    "start": 2282.16,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "the earth was not the center of the",
    "start": 2285.28,
    "duration": 4.079
  },
  {
    "text": "universe.",
    "start": 2287.2,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And yet now we're we're trying to do",
    "start": 2289.359,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "something even harder,",
    "start": 2293.2,
    "duration": 5.919
  },
  {
    "text": "which is to move from an egocentric",
    "start": 2295.599,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "model where the self is the center of",
    "start": 2299.119,
    "duration": 5.281
  },
  {
    "text": "the universe",
    "start": 2302.079,
    "duration": 6.921
  },
  {
    "text": "to a truly empathic life.",
    "start": 2304.4,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "where an empathic life where the kind of",
    "start": 2309.28,
    "duration": 10.079
  },
  {
    "text": "set of conditions that we name as",
    "start": 2313.68,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "me",
    "start": 2319.359,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "are not worthy of such dramatic",
    "start": 2322.16,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "elevation",
    "start": 2324.96,
    "duration": 6.6
  },
  {
    "text": "over other sets of conditions.",
    "start": 2327.2,
    "duration": 4.36
  },
  {
    "text": "And this means that uh",
    "start": 2332.88,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "we",
    "start": 2337.839,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "stop taking our own side",
    "start": 2341.119,
    "duration": 5.521
  },
  {
    "text": "every time",
    "start": 2344.72,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "everywhere.",
    "start": 2346.64,
    "duration": 4.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Me",
    "start": 2349.04,
    "duration": 4.799
  },
  {
    "text": "me I win again.",
    "start": 2350.64,
    "duration": 6.199
  },
  {
    "text": "No",
    "start": 2353.839,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "lose.",
    "start": 2356.96,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "As our understanding",
    "start": 2362.16,
    "duration": 4.32
  },
  {
    "text": "uh",
    "start": 2364.4,
    "duration": 4.719
  },
  {
    "text": "deepens,",
    "start": 2366.48,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "we no longer treat others as kind of",
    "start": 2369.119,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "objects in our personal world. It's easy",
    "start": 2372.4,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "to do that. We actually start to enter",
    "start": 2375.28,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "the world of others.",
    "start": 2378.72,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "The dharma connects us in this way to",
    "start": 2382.16,
    "duration": 6.64
  },
  {
    "text": "others. It's resonant. It's maybe we say",
    "start": 2385.04,
    "duration": 7.799
  },
  {
    "text": "its nature is empathic.",
    "start": 2388.8,
    "duration": 4.039
  },
  {
    "text": "And it's very easy to live what is",
    "start": 2393.599,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "effectively a solopscistic life",
    "start": 2397.359,
    "duration": 8.24
  },
  {
    "text": "only vaguely sensing",
    "start": 2401.599,
    "duration": 6.641
  },
  {
    "text": "that the other exists when we're not",
    "start": 2405.599,
    "duration": 5.641
  },
  {
    "text": "looking.",
    "start": 2408.24,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "This is very easy to box a loved one",
    "start": 2411.76,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "into the role that they play for us.",
    "start": 2415.119,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Father, mother, sister, brother,",
    "start": 2419.52,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "sibling, spouse,",
    "start": 2423.119,
    "duration": 5.321
  },
  {
    "text": "child.",
    "start": 2425.44,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the the uh research world uh empathy is",
    "start": 2431.119,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "often defined as something like",
    "start": 2435.44,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "perspective taking the ability to",
    "start": 2437.119,
    "duration": 5.601
  },
  {
    "text": "consciously put oneself in the mind of",
    "start": 2440.64,
    "duration": 4.08
  },
  {
    "text": "another",
    "start": 2442.72,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "and the capacity the willingness to",
    "start": 2444.72,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "become effectively aroused by",
    "start": 2447.52,
    "duration": 8.16
  },
  {
    "text": "the other's inner life effectively",
    "start": 2451.92,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "emotional vena feeling",
    "start": 2455.68,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "and there's some empathic concern where",
    "start": 2460.0,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "we're we're motivated to",
    "start": 2462.4,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "uh we're not indifferent. We're",
    "start": 2465.92,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "motivated to care for another's welfare.",
    "start": 2467.68,
    "duration": 9.36
  },
  {
    "text": "And that's what it means to",
    "start": 2472.4,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "uh to truly understand",
    "start": 2477.04,
    "duration": 8.68
  },
  {
    "text": "each other to learn to be open systems.",
    "start": 2480.0,
    "duration": 5.72
  },
  {
    "text": "And um",
    "start": 2486.48,
    "duration": 3.56
  },
  {
    "text": "in a way it's kind of it can feel like",
    "start": 2491.52,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "strange phrase maybe but it's like we",
    "start": 2494.8,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "take our cues as best we can from the",
    "start": 2497.119,
    "duration": 7.561
  },
  {
    "text": "mind of the Buddha",
    "start": 2501.04,
    "duration": 3.64
  },
  {
    "text": "listening.",
    "start": 2505.92,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Over time, we we develop a kind of",
    "start": 2511.839,
    "duration": 10.081
  },
  {
    "text": "highly detailed topographical map of our",
    "start": 2515.68,
    "duration": 8.8
  },
  {
    "text": "goodness and our neurosis.",
    "start": 2521.92,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "And that um",
    "start": 2524.48,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "high",
    "start": 2528.48,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "resolution",
    "start": 2530.16,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "map uh expands dramatically expands the",
    "start": 2532.24,
    "duration": 8.599
  },
  {
    "text": "possibilities for empathy.",
    "start": 2536.72,
    "duration": 4.119
  },
  {
    "text": "So Strummer said, \"Uh, Jim, our our job",
    "start": 2542.079,
    "duration": 9.24
  },
  {
    "text": "is to protect empathy at all costs.\"",
    "start": 2544.8,
    "duration": 6.519
  },
  {
    "text": "And that, uh, Jenny Beth said is a it's",
    "start": 2551.76,
    "duration": 7.48
  },
  {
    "text": "its own political act.",
    "start": 2555.2,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "It doesn't feel sufficient for sure,",
    "start": 2560.16,
    "duration": 6.4
  },
  {
    "text": "but",
    "start": 2564.96,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "she seems right to me, too.",
    "start": 2566.56,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "And in the long run, the long run, our",
    "start": 2570.56,
    "duration": 7.84
  },
  {
    "text": "world does need an unbroken",
    "start": 2573.68,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "lineage",
    "start": 2578.4,
    "duration": 8.52
  },
  {
    "text": "of love and care, empathic concern.",
    "start": 2580.24,
    "duration": 6.68
  },
  {
    "text": "And so let us do our part.",
    "start": 2588.24,
    "duration": 4.28
  },
  {
    "text": "And I think we are in our own ways doing",
    "start": 2593.359,
    "duration": 6.401
  },
  {
    "text": "our part.",
    "start": 2596.96,
    "duration": 6.96
  },
  {
    "text": "That's not where our effort ends, but um",
    "start": 2599.76,
    "duration": 8.68
  },
  {
    "text": "certainly a good starting point.",
    "start": 2603.92,
    "duration": 4.52
  },
  {
    "text": "and hear um",
    "start": 2608.96,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "these Wednesdays if you're listening",
    "start": 2611.68,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "you can hear that every week",
    "start": 2615.04,
    "duration": 6.88
  },
  {
    "text": "talking about this country",
    "start": 2618.0,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "and",
    "start": 2621.92,
    "duration": 3.76
  },
  {
    "text": "um",
    "start": 2624.16,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "also every week talking about",
    "start": 2625.68,
    "duration": 8.639
  },
  {
    "text": "uh what's been here before this country",
    "start": 2629.04,
    "duration": 10.079
  },
  {
    "text": "and what will be here after the dream as",
    "start": 2634.319,
    "duration": 6.881
  },
  {
    "text": "seeds to",
    "start": 2639.119,
    "duration": 4.081
  },
  {
    "text": "time",
    "start": 2641.2,
    "duration": 5.0
  },
  {
    "text": "delusion.",
    "start": 2643.2,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "This is not uh",
    "start": 2647.68,
    "duration": 8.12
  },
  {
    "text": "the dharma's uh first rodeo.",
    "start": 2650.88,
    "duration": 4.92
  },
  {
    "text": "Let us uh",
    "start": 2663.119,
    "duration": 3.641
  },
  {
    "text": "uh protect",
    "start": 2667.599,
    "duration": 4.921
  },
  {
    "text": "empathy.",
    "start": 2669.52,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Offer this for your consideration.",
    "start": 2673.52,
    "duration": 4.52
  }
]